{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Review Government Departments\u2019 handling of prevention of future deaths reports",
        "additional_details": "In one such instance, multiple prevention of future deaths reports were submitted to Government Departments to warn them about a harmful online suicide forum which promoted the sale of poison. We believe the Government did not do enough to act on this. We therefore call for a review to ensure prevention of future deaths reports are met with the immediate and serious response they require, to prevent future harm.",
        "background": "We call for a review into how Government departments handle prevention of future deaths reports. We are concerned that there have been multiple instances where such reports have not been acted on.",
